msgstr ""
"Prevalans her satırda aynıdır: bu, o patern içindeki oran değil, tüm "
"örneklemdeki hastalık oranıdır."

#: R/sequentialtests.b.R
msgid ""
"Prevalence is low (%.2f%%). Below 5%% pre-test probability, PPV is dominated "
"by specificity: a one-percentage-point change in specificity can move PPV by "
"tens of points. Verify the specificity assumptions and the intended "
"population."
msgstr ""

#: R/decisioncombine.b.R
msgid ""
"Prevalence is the same in every row: it is the disease rate in the whole "
"sample, not the rate within that pattern. Balanced Accuracy and Youden's J "
"are the same statistic on two scales (Balanced Accuracy = (J + 1) / 2), so "
"ranking by one is identical to ranking by the other."
msgstr ""
"Prevalans her satırda aynıdır: bu, o patern içindeki oran değil, tüm "
"örneklemdeki hastalık oranıdır. Dengeli Doğruluk ve Youden J iki ölçekte "
"aynı istatistiktir (Dengeli Doğruluk = (J + 1) / 2), bu nedenle birine göre "
"sıralama diğeriyle sıralama ile özdeştir."

#: R/sequentialtests.b.R
msgid ""
"Prevalence is very high (%.1f%%). Verify that this assumption matches the "
